{"hymn":"S135","parent":"E172","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Anhelo respirarte más","subtitle":"Alabanza al Señor—Su belleza","syl":{"n1":["An","i"],"n2":["he","m"],"n3":["lo","t"],"n4":["res","i"],"n5":["pi","m"],"n6":["rar","m"],"n7":["te","t"],"n8":"más","n9":["Bri","i"],"n10":["sa","t"],"n11":"de","n12":["gra","i"],"n13":["to‿o","m"],"n14":["lor;","t"],"n15":["Co","i"],"n16":["mo","t"],"n17":["fra","i"],"n18":["gan","m"],"n19":["cia","t"],"n20":["ce","i"],"n21":["les","m"],"n22":["tial,","t"],"n23":"La","n24":"flor","n25":["de‿al","i"],"n26":["he","m"],"n27":["ña‿es","t"],"n28":"sin","n29":["i","i"],"n30":["gual,","t"],"n31":"Un","n32":["bál","i"],"n33":["sa","m"],"n34":["mo","t"],"n35":["de‿a","i"],"n36":["mor,","t"],"n37":"Un","n38":["bál","i"],"n39":["sa","m"],"n40":["mo","t"],"n41":["de‿a","i"],"n42":["mor.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Anhelo contemplarte más,","Hermoso Redentor;","Mi corazón muy lleno está","Mirando Tu gloriosa faz;","//Qué bello resplandor!//"]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Anhelo‿a Ti rendirme más","Mi Amo,‿Amigo, Dios;","Someto a Ti mi voluntad","Para servir sin vacilar","//En santa devoción.//"]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Anhelo alabarte más,","Tu nombre‿es mi canción;","Con melodía celestial","Mi alma‿a Ti cantando está;","//Me alegra el corazón.//"]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Anhelo elogiarte más,","Hay mucho que exponer;","Con tanto‿amor te quiero hablar","Mas oigo un dulce susurrar:","//\"Ten paz, todo está bien\".//"]}]}